    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="structscc_1_1dmi__mgr" kindref="compound">dmi_mgr</ref> class manages Direct Memory Interface (DMI) transactions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="structscc_1_1dmi__mgr" kindref="compound">dmi_mgr</ref> class is a template class that provides DMI management functionality. It interacts with the TLM (Transaction Level Modeling) framework to handle DMI transactions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TYPES</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The TLM protocol types.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The <ref refid="structscc_1_1dmi__mgr" kindref="compound">dmi_mgr</ref> class is a part of the SystemC Component (SCC) library. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
